        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Bastarz, Block B\n- Products: Conduct Zero, Welcome 2 Bastarz\n- People: Taeil, B-Bomb, Jaehyo, U-Kwon, Park Kyung, Zico, P.O.\n\nFacts:\n- Block B consists of seven members: Taeil, B-Bomb, Jaehyo, U-Kwon, Park Kyung, Zico, and P.O.\n- Bastarz is the first official sub-unit of the South Korean boy group Block B.\n- Bastarz debuted with its first mini album, \"Conduct Zero,\" on April 14, 2015.\n- Bastarz released its second mini album, \"Welcome 2 Bastarz,\" on October 31, 2016.",
